    ["the_deadmines"] = {
        { 92747, "A", 9, 16, "Alba Fairmoon", "Westfall 52.4,53", nil, false, {92745}, nil, "Collect 8 Suspicious Industrial Supplies from Moonbrook. The crates are not on the town streets — they are inside the building leading to the Deadmines entrance, down the path into the cave.", "毒素调查链的一环：几处矿井的样本都查过了，线索都指向月溪镇下方的死亡矿井。到月溪镇收集补给品，回阿尔巴·晴月处交任务后开启爆炸物筹备段。前导环《测井》的两个采样点：莫尔森农场 46.2,38.3、詹森农庄 56.7,18.7。◎ 补给箱就在通往死矿入口的洞穴里，月溪镇各建筑（包括月溪学校）里也散落着一些，不用打精英。", {{9,1}, {12,2}, {14,3}, {19,4}, {23,5}}, nil, nil, 253092, "Alba Fairmoon", { xp = 575, money = 400, rep = { {72, 50, "Stormwind City"} } } },
        { 92753, "A", 9, 18, "Alba Fairmoon", "Westfall 52.4,53", nil, false, {92752}, nil, "Find the furnace deep inside the Deadmines and place the Powerful Blasting Charge beside it; then rendezvous with Alba Fairmoon at the Deadmines exit.", "The dungeon segment of the chain: before entering, the explosives are already prepared by the materiel phase (Sprite Jumpsprocket → Jasper Fel). After planting them, exit the dungeon and meet Alba Fairmoon on the hill behind Moonbrook. ◎ The forge is the room where Gilnid spawns — plant the explosives near the center; after this run do NOT hearth out: leave through the back door and continue the quest at the back entrance.", {{9,1}, {14,2}, {16,3}, {21,4}, {25,5}}, nil, nil, 253092, "Alba Fairmoon", { xp = 4050, rep = { {72, 50, "Stormwind City"} } } },
        { 92819, "A", 9, 18, "Alba Fairmoon", "Westfall - the hill behind Moonbrook 38.6,83.2", "Destruction in Deadmines", false, {92753}, nil, "Use the remote detonator to set off the charge placed beside the furnace.", "《爆破死亡矿井》的收尾环：与月溪镇后方山丘的阿尔巴·晴月会合后，使用起爆器收尾。", {{9,1}, {14,2}, {16,3}, {21,4}, {25,5}}, nil, nil, 253279, "Alba Fairmoon", { rep = { {72, 50, "Stormwind City"} } } },
        { 166, "A", 14, 22, "Marshal Gryan Stoutmantle", "Westfall - Sentinel Hill 56,47", "Red Silk Bandanas", false, {155}, {6087, 2041, 2042}, "Kill Edwin VanCleef and bring his head back to Marshal Gryan Stoutmantle.", "整个系列从格里安·斯托曼(西部荒野-哨兵岭 56,47)开始。范克里夫是死亡矿井的最终 首领，在船的最上层。", {{14,1}, {18,2}, {20,3}, {25,4}, {29,5}}, {3637}, nil, 234, "Marshal Gryan Stoutmantle", { xp = 2600, rep = { {72, 200, "Stormwind City"} } } },
        { 168, "A", 14, 18, "Wilder Thistlenettle", "Stormwind City - Dwarven District 70,41", nil, false, nil, {2037, 2036, 270007}, "Collect 4 Miners' Union Membership Cards and bring them to Wilder Thistlenettle in Stormwind City.", "Union cards drop from the undead near the dungeon entrance. ◎ The drop rate is very low and they are NOT shared among the group (everyone loots their own) — expect a long grind.", {{14,2}, {16,3}, {21,4}, {25,5}}, {1894}, nil, 656, "Wilder Thistlenettle", { xp = 1350, rep = { {47, 100, "Ironforge"} } } },
        { 214, "A", 14, 17, "Scout Riell", "Westfall - Sentinel Hill 56, 47", "Red Silk Bandanas", false, {155}, {2074, 2089, 6094, 270005}, "Collect 10 Red Silk Bandanas and bring them to Scout Riell in the watchtower of Sentinel Hill.", "副本内外的矿工都会掉面罩。要先完成《护送迪菲亚叛徒》才会开放这个任务。", {{14,2}, {15,3}, {20,4}, {24,5}}, {915}, nil, 820, "Scout Riell", { xp = 1250, rep = { {72, 100, "Stormwind City"} } } },
