        { 1318, nil, 56, 60, nil, nil, nil, false, nil, {18366, 18367, 18368, 18369}, nil, "Doable in one run. Recommended route: North first (tribute run — bring the ogre-suit materials and the broken trap) → West (kill Immol'thar) → Library (kill Prince Tortheldrin) → back to North, turn in to Fengus on the way out.", {{56,2}, {58,3}, {63,4}, {72,5}}, {18336}, nil, nil, nil, { xp = 8300 } },
